            <ArticleTitle>[Determination of chlorphenoxyisobutyrate in the blood of chronic ischemic heart disease patients under prolonged miscleron treatment].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>335-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A new modification is described of the gas chromatographic method for determining chlorphenoxyisobutyrate in blood plasma of patients. Apart from providing good results, the method shows high sensitivity and insignificant discrepancies in the parallel tests. The time course of changes in blood chlorphenoxyisobutyrate, depending on miscleron doses and treatment regimens over a period of three months, has been shown with reference to examination of 40 patients with chronic ischemic heart disease associated with hyperlipoproteinemia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
